1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,744
Sekelompok pemuda tertidur di

2
00:00:01,764 --> 00:00:02,332
sebuah gua.

3
00:00:02,352 --> 00:00:03,415
Saat bangun,

4
00:00:03,435 --> 00:00:05,069
mereka mengira baru sehari.

5
00:00:05,089 --> 00:00:07,325
Padahal, 309 tahun sudah

6
00:00:07,345 --> 00:00:08,438
lewat.

7
00:00:08,458 --> 00:00:10,357
Kisah ini ada di surah

8
00:00:10,377 --> 00:00:12,595
Al-Kahfi, ayat sembilan sampai

9
00:00:12,615 --> 00:00:13,528
dua puluh enam.

10
00:00:13,548 --> 00:00:14,937
Para pemuda itu hidup di

11
00:00:14,957 --> 00:00:16,222
tengah kaum yang menyembah

12
00:00:16,242 --> 00:00:17,131
selain Allah.

13
00:00:17,151 --> 00:00:18,927
Mereka memilih tetap beriman,

14
00:00:18,947 --> 00:00:20,263
walau taruhannya nyawa.

15
00:00:20,283 --> 00:00:22,015
Mereka berlindung ke dalam gua

16
00:00:22,035 --> 00:00:22,774
dan berdoa:

17
00:00:22,794 --> 00:00:23,981
Ya Tuhan kami,

18
00:00:24,001 --> 00:00:25,913
berikan rahmat dari sisi-Mu,

19
00:00:25,933 --> 00:00:27,260
dan sempurnakan petunjuk bagi

20
00:00:27,280 --> 00:00:28,203
urusan kami.

21
00:00:28,223 --> 00:00:30,301
Lalu Allah menidurkan mereka.

22
00:00:30,321 --> 00:00:31,973
Matahari terbit condong ke

23
00:00:31,993 --> 00:00:32,747
kanan gua,

24
00:00:32,767 --> 00:00:34,078
dan saat terbenam menjauh ke

25
00:00:34,098 --> 00:00:34,750
kiri.

26
00:00:34,770 --> 00:00:36,190
Tubuh mereka dibolak-balik ke

27
00:00:36,210 --> 00:00:37,868
kanan dan ke kiri.

28
00:00:37,888 --> 00:00:39,385
Anjing mereka berjaga,

29
00:00:39,405 --> 00:00:40,593
membentangkan kedua kaki

30
00:00:40,613 --> 00:00:42,347
depannya di ambang pintu.

31
00:00:42,367 --> 00:00:43,904
Lalu mereka dibangunkan.

32
00:00:43,924 --> 00:00:45,003
Salah seorang bertanya,

33
00:00:45,023 --> 00:00:46,087
sudah berapa lama kita di

34
00:00:46,107 --> 00:00:46,678
sini?

35
00:00:46,698 --> 00:00:48,874
Sehari, atau setengah hari,

36
00:00:48,894 --> 00:00:49,885
jawab yang lain.

37
00:00:49,905 --> 00:00:52,021
Satu orang diutus ke kota

38
00:00:52,041 --> 00:00:53,786
membawa uang perak untuk

39
00:00:53,806 --> 00:00:54,529
membeli makanan,

40
00:00:54,549 --> 00:00:55,361
dengan pesan:

41
00:00:55,381 --> 00:00:56,487
jangan sampai ketahuan.

42
00:00:56,507 --> 00:00:57,570
Ayat dua puluh lima menyebut

43
00:00:57,590 --> 00:00:58,081
angkanya:

44
00:00:58,101 --> 00:00:59,088
tiga ratus tahun,

45
00:00:59,108 --> 00:01:00,001
ditambah sembilan.

46
00:01:00,021 --> 00:01:01,255
Ibnu Katsir menjelaskan,

47
00:01:01,275 --> 00:01:02,369
tiga ratus tahun matahari

48
00:01:02,389 --> 00:01:03,360
setara dengan tiga ratus

49
00:01:03,380 --> 00:01:04,671
sembilan tahun bulan.

50
00:01:04,691 --> 00:01:05,987
Lalu berapa jumlah mereka?

51
00:01:06,007 --> 00:01:06,916
Orang menebak tiga,

52
00:01:06,936 --> 00:01:08,136
lima, atau tujuh.

53
00:01:08,156 --> 00:01:09,328
Al-Qur'an menjawab:

54
00:01:09,348 --> 00:01:10,779
Tuhanku lebih mengetahui.

55
00:01:10,799 --> 00:01:11,925
Di tengah kisah ini pula ada

56
00:01:11,945 --> 00:01:12,281
pesan:

57
00:01:12,301 --> 00:01:13,782
jangan berkata akan melakukan

58
00:01:13,802 --> 00:01:14,541
sesuatu besok,

59
00:01:14,561 --> 00:01:16,172
kecuali dengan insya Allah.

60
00:01:16,192 --> 00:01:17,518
Pemuda yang memilih iman

61
00:01:17,538 --> 00:01:19,462
dijaga melewati tiga abad.

62
00:01:19,482 --> 00:01:21,226
Keteguhan kecil di masa sulit

63
00:01:21,246 --> 00:01:22,992
bisa bertahan melampaui zaman.

64
00:01:23,012 --> 00:01:23,813
Menurut kamu,

65
00:01:23,833 --> 00:01:25,763
apa gua tempatmu berlindung

66
00:01:25,783 --> 00:01:26,802
hari ini?

